  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Time-critical support to farming families to restore local production of nutritious food and enhance food security in the Gaza Strip</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The food and nutrition security situation of the conflict-affected women, youth and men in the Gaza Strip is improved. In response to the current humanitarian crisis and needs, FAO seeks to contribute to decreasing the risk of malnutrition while protecting the right to food and restoring conflict-affected livelihoods. The project aims to enhance food security and nutrition in the Gaza Strip by improving the access to fresh and nutritious food.</narrative>
  </description>
